%% render: auto
%% title: Hardware and execution architecture
%% desc: Keep light tools and heavy model environments apart. Requirements come from each guide, never from assumptions about a machine.
flowchart TD
    A["Documentation and planning • any machine, no GPU"]:::slate
    B["Browser frontend and Three.js • Node and a browser"]:::blue
    C["Blender authoring and rendering • CPU or GPU"]:::amber
    F["Isolated environments • one venv or container per model"]:::slate
    D["Local model inference • NVIDIA GPU, per-model VRAM"]:::amber
    E["Reconstruction training • Gaussian Splatting, high VRAM"]:::teal
    G["Optional authorized remote compute • no private data"]:::rose
    H["Validated artifacts • reports, renders, manifests"]:::green
    A --> B
    A --> C
    A --> F
    F --> D
    F --> E
    D -.->|if VRAM is short| G
    E -->|splat PLY| H
    B -->|build| H
    C -->|GLB, renders| H
    D -->|meshes| H
